    "sourceScan": 59
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "\"Is it because your father fell in battle that you grieve?\" he asked.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 59,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "\"No, my love!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 59,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "If one warrior is lost from the army of this jasmine-girdled land,",
