   },
   {
    "kind": "stanza-break",
    "evidence": "source-blank-line",
    "sourceScan": 60
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "★",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "★",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "★",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "stanza-break",
    "evidence": "source-blank-line",
    "sourceScan": 60
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Warriors came — \"Victory belongs to your husband!\" they said!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "The king's messengers came! They offered their congratulations!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Women from the neighbourhood came — they read aloud",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "the long victory scroll and rejoiced! That beauty",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "shed tears of joy — then,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "why did that man come?",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "To tell the news of death! —",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "\"My precious woman!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "My dear — do not be shaken!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Hear the news from the field, the final news,\" he said —",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "stanza-break",
    "evidence": "source-blank-line",
    "sourceScan": 60
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Alas!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "The man who, beneath mango-leaf festoons, on the wedding dais,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "said, \"We have become one in life\" —",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "took a spear in his chest and fell in a good death —",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "that woman who must live on though the life-breath has gone,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "that Tamil lotus cast in type —",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "cried aloud — \"A cluster of flowers,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "this family!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Cruel death has plucked it",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "without sparing the cluster!\" She reviled it —",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "spoke bitterly of it! \"What remains for me now!\"",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "she cried, and cried that the fruit",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "had rotted away!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "stanza-break",
    "evidence": "source-blank-line",
    "sourceScan": 60
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Showing eyes that could shame the dew,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "speaking words sweet as syrup,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "singing poems in the bridal chamber —",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "are all those days now only earth?",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "From now on, are these eyes never to sleep?",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "So she wept! Toward the field",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "where her husband's body lay, she bowed!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 60,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "page-transition",
    "fromScan": 60,
    "toScan": 61,
    "stanzaRelation": "unknown",
    "textualRelation": "not-specifically-recorded",
    "evidence": {
     "stanza": [],
     "textual": []
    }
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Collapsed in grief, she heard in her ears",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "the war-drum beaten by the enemy in the speed of victory —",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "and that was enough;",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "\"Ruined is ruined — let our whole clan",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "be wiped out if it must!\"",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "she rose and said.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "\"I shall live for the land of measureless fame,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "not for the house!\"",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "stanza-break",
    "evidence": "source-blank-line",
    "sourceScan": 61
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Queen among the women of Tamil land, who knew",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "to measure time with the water clock,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "she remembered the pure treasure she had raised in the cradle,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "who had gone to learn, without fail,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "from the teacher beneath the banyan tree!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "She went there — \"Amma!\" he cried and sprang toward her,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "that gold of love with his beautiful child's speech.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "\"Have Appa and Thatha returned home?\" he asked —",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "\"They returned — and have gone on to the town of death.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Sugarcane-sweet one — you too, come,\" she called.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "\"What did they bring back?\" he asked!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "\"Honour! Honour! Undying honour,\" she said —",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "\"My son! You too must come and taste it,\" she said.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "stanza-break",
    "evidence": "source-blank-line",
    "sourceScan": 61
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "He came — the tender shoot of the clan!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "The lamp of the household still burning, she told him:",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "\"Because of the enemy's invasion, our family has become,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "little brother, a tree that has shed its leaves!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "No sorrow — they went to the field; they died!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "And yet, as long as this earth remains,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "they have taken the name 'those who guarded honour'!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "My son! As long as strength remains in your shoulders,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "strike the enemy!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Sing a Parani! This is your",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "sacred motherland! — run at once!\" Thus,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "she sprang, embraced her tender son,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "combed and dressed him, placed in his hand",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "a sword stained saffron-red with blood,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "and blessed him:",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "\"Go, my son.. toward the battle-front!\"",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Who is there that would not praise and sing",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "that scene from the sacred Tamil land —",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "O noble woman! — in this flower-world?",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 61,
    "printedPage": null
   }
  ],
